Instruction on how you created the tools isolation for this product.
Please include platform you installed on, where you installed it, what
you copied where, etc.:

Downloaded the DIS-1.1.0.zip to my Windows box. Then extracted the zip into folder DIS-1.1.0 and checked 
the JAR files from DIS-1.1.0.zip/bin and DIS-1.1.0/lib in CMVC into adks/ibm/it_registry/1.1:
	bin/COMMON.jar
	bin/DCS.jar
	bin/DIS.jar
	bin/METADATA.jar
	bin/NRS.jar
	bin/NLS.jar
	bin/NLS-LANG.jar
	cli/bin/BULKLOAD.jar
	cli/bin/CLI.jar
	lib/icl.jar
The contents of folder DIS-1.1.0/dbscript were compressed to archive it_registry_dbscript.zip and placed in CMVC 
into adks/ibm/it_registry/1.1. 
	
